%% Backend-to-Blockchain Integration
flowchart LR
  UI[React web client] -->|HTTPS REST / JSON| API[Spring Boot REST API]
  API --> SEC[Authentication and RBAC]
  API --> SVC[Domain services]
  SVC --> DB[(PostgreSQL operational data)]
  SVC --> EVENT[Event status metadata + idempotency]
  SVC --> BCS[Blockchain adapter]
  BCS --> RPC[Blockchain RPC]
  RPC --> SC[LoanEvents smart contract]
  Borrower --> UI
  Officer[Loan Officer] --> UI
  Admin[Administrator] --> UI
